# Perceived performance

Make the UI feel fast. Feedback must start on press; long work must show progress; important success must not be silent.

## Do

- Wire shared `Button` `isLoading` from mutation/pending state (see `frontend-button-loading.mdc`)
- For long work (upload, payment redirect, multi-step): show progress or clear status text
- Confirm important success (payments, registrations, votes) via toast and/or an explicit success state
- On failure, explain how to fix it — see `clear-error-messages.mdc`
- While data loads, use existing loaders / empty states — never a blank screen

## Don't

- Await the network before showing button loading / disabled state
- Leave long tasks with only a frozen screen and no progress
- Succeed silently on important mutations
- Invent a second toast when the API `message` is already shown
